# Status updates (Roman Urdu)

- User prefers **Roman Urdu** for progress / status summaries.
- **After every update / slice / fix**, end (or include) a short status:
  - **Ho gaya:** what was completed this turn
  - **Baqi:** what remains (if any)
- Keep it short — bullet style, not long English recap unless they ask English.
- Scope reminder when relevant: coffee dashboard Themes Customize + Page Builder only (not flowers/cars) unless they expand scope.
